==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 and 2'''===
This stage supports Cadaver Bear with Ursamajor and Doge Darks, likely necessitating the use of 3+ meatshields. This is one of the hardest outbreaks yet. Units that outrange Cadaver Bear such as [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] will be useful here, and required if you don't have a high range uber or [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat/Shigong Cat]]. Sifu/Shigong Cat can permanently stall Cadaver Bear, deal significant damage, and ZKill him. However, if you do not have all or most of the unstarred alien crystals from later chapters, Ursamajor can deal large amounts of damage to Sifu/Shigong. Once Cadaver Bear is defeated, victory is almost guaranteed, as a lone Ursamajor has minimal pushing power.

In Chapter 2, Those guys are replaced with Thrillerz, and Ursamajor is buffed to 600% magnification. The Thrillerz are extremely annoying here, as they can burrow and stop your meatshields. The extra magnifications on Ursamajor effectively force you to clear almost all of ITF 3 and collect all unstarred alien treasures before attempting this stage, but even with them it could still be very challenging without good gacha units or Awakened Bahamut. Cadaver Bear only gains small stat boosts, so units useful in chapter 1 are still helpful here. However, because this stage forces you to clear almost all of  ITF 3, you will likely also have Awakened Bahamut by this point. Bahamut can cripple both bears significantly if he lands his attack. If you have Awakened Bahamut and can time decently well, expect a pretty easy victory.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The main issue here is not Elizabeth the LVIth, but rather the Zuches and the surprise Metal Doges. You can deal with the Metal Doges with three or four meatshields or ([[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]) [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]], but the combination of Elizabeth's [[Wave Attack|waves]] and Metal Doges means you must kill Elizabeth first or use a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitter]] when the five Metal Doges arrive.

[[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and their [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|counterparts]] are reasonable choices here. Use [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to deal with the peons. Make sure to reserve some attacker/[[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] when you see the Zuche run towards your base, and make him burrow far away from your base; remember there will be three Zuches. [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercat]] will certainly help here.

